    "article_summary": "The article describes a dual photoredox- and nickel-catalyzed decarboxylative aminocarbonylation of (hetero)aryl bromides using oxamic acids as carbamoyl radical precursors. The method utilizes the organic photocatalyst 4CzIPN and NiCl2\u00b7glyme to produce various amides under mild conditions, avoiding toxic CO gas and precious metal catalysts. The study also demonstrates a protocol for the synthesis of deuterated formamides.",
